// Q-1371 An attribute's `{` left open after a lambda's block (`onclick={() => { n += 1 }>`) is reported as the button's text, "unexpected character `♥`" with the newer-Quillo note, or "expected an expression, found `+`", not as the missing `}`
// mode: check
// open-when: unexpected character `♥`
// fixed-when: `}`
// From FEEDBACK87.md §Q-1371 (found on 61997ab).
component Like() {
    state n = 0
    <button onclick={() => { n += 1 }>♥ {n}</button>
}
route GET / = <Like/>
